cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "IP Camera Privacy Gateway"
abstract: >-
  Code and measurement results for the paper "Edge Computing-Based Privacy Preservation
  for IP Cameras Using Two-Track Stream Branching and Cryptographic Credentials": a Raspberry Pi 5
  gateway that gives a registered browser the raw camera stream and every other viewer a stream
  with people blurred, plus the scripts behind the speed and masking evaluations.
